Cold calling capabilities;
Passionate about sales;
Self-motivated, goal oriented with a desire and ability to meet targets and deliver results;
Fast learner who can adapt in a competitive environment;
Eagerness to learn about and understand the software and its features;
An understanding of technology and software use;
Able to use MS Office and its features;
The ability to speak another South African language is encouraged.
